Rule 7 (If input and target tensors are both 0-dimensional, then reduction must be 'none')
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : str} |= if (ndim(v_1) = 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 0) then v_3 = "none"
>>
