{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : str} |= if v_3 = "none" then dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
>>
Rule 9 (If input is a complex type, the target should also be a complex type)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if (dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10) then (dtype_(v_2) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 10)
